  "_note": "The GUI's colours (ADR-055, doctrine/00-foundations.md §5: no hardcoded colours), in the three themes of the tactics board (DESIGN.md: Lavagna, Notte, Carta), the first the default. Hex, #rrggbb or #rrggbbaa. dark: the interface around the board is dark (else light). board the background around the pitch; pitch and pitch_stripe the grass in bands; lines the markings and the goals; home and away the two sides, keeper_home and keeper_away their goalkeepers; carrier_ring around the man on the ball; player_text and number_dark the number on a token (light on dark sides, dark on light ones), rim_light the edge of a black token; card_yellow and card_red the referee's cards; ball_edge the ball's rim; postit, postit_ink and postit_shadow the bench post-it; stadium the stands, the town and the sky; ball_shadow the shadows on the grass; critical, high, medium and low the commentary by the importance of the event."
